d5f468dfef363ddcfba1e40cd41a0493dd3136a8 blob 3182
# npm full-inventory pin rebinding v2

PREPARATION_ONLY_NOT_A_GRANT. Different review and fresh ROOT GO required.

Packet commit: `7ef6e6b816ccc6b2449605c7950ab825d148a529`. Code/auth commit: `a52819daa6ff2c867187b01a7a5bbbb189f0da02`.

The eight-file packet changes only BINDINGS npm /sha256 and its dependent MANIFEST. Six files are byte-identical historical packet copies. Runtime copies change only seven explicit metadata/path/authentication literals; reverse allowlist comparison preserves all other bytes. The physical future-run-01 root, source/installed/moved parents, original budget, ID, deadline and counters remain unchanged. No new allocation, clock, GO or dispatch.

## Future command (DO NOT RUN during preparation)

Only after different review and fresh ROOT approval may the template become the versioned GO.json named here; the template itself is not a grant.

```sh
'/Users/kjopek/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.2/bin/node' '/Users/kjopek/Workspace/safe-bash/tests/integration/priority-command-workflows-20260828/npm-pin-rebinding-v2/future-supervisor.mjs' '--grant' '/Users/kjopek/Workspace/safe-bash/tests/integration/priority-command-workflows-20260828/npm-pin-rebinding-v2/GO.json' '--budget' '/Users/kjopek/Workspace/safe-bash/tests/integration/priority-command-workflows-20260828/PARENT-BUDGET.json'
```

Template: `GO-v3.template.json`; SHA-256 `6f155760db46aef36e511e15a40a29690ce929c9a78c59366ef6d2cd2d9d47fb`.
Seal: `PREPARATION-SEAL-v3.json`; SHA-256 `ab4fb40a7c4f73ddc9a34dba1ebc8a081b214f7fbec549a8b34539b241b39812`.
Code14 mapped identity: `4c68d92094b8b5478ba012b77e79024db908f0eff517059c80bc80946cefc9af`.

`REBINDING.json` provides complete original/replacement path, byte-length and hash mapping, stored commit identities versus derived composition, canonical npm domains, unchanged originals and immutable reservation. `CONTROLS.json` records 34 DATA controls (12 positive, 22 negative), the initial setup failures and corrected DATA-harness defects, plus measured preseal child settlement. Final commit/status settlement is reported separately to avoid self-reference.

334 original stored-object requests authenticated in one Git batch; all314 source-auth rows retained with exactly8 rebound packet rows. All8 code/auth and8 packet artifacts independently resolved at actual immutable commit:path. Derived8437 recomputed from268authenticated inputs; full858-file package6b unchanged.

All2039 preserved HOLD rows equal authenticated archive originalRows; 2027 regular rows retain exact content and0644/0755 modes. Exactly12internal .bin symlinks explain931canonical bytes. No current npm scan or post-HOLD drift claim.

No source evaluation, product imports, compiler/npm/version/install/native/network/comparator/private/XAN/arrays execution, supervisor, setup, Worker or loader execution. All93 calls remain unrun. F1-F4 historical behavior preserved by byte equivalence outside explicit metadata changes, not newly executed acceptance. Original99seal pins map to99current bindings plus the original seal itself (100pins); historical qualification is not relabeled current. Postchecks cover original enumerated files, not an append-proof tree.

