d2e97c930422018d2f8992ecdef968af31ba52e3 blob 1064
# Unexecuted reporting follow-up — DATA only

August 28, 2026. Root requested a known-start accounting follow-up before the
reviewer authenticated the v3 documentation qualification. Two executable files
and a DATA helper had already been edited, but nothing new was executed and no
v4 protocol or seal was created. Root then explicitly chose exact v3 restoration.

This archive preserves the unapplied source diff and complete unexecuted helper
bytes as nonexecutable `.data` text, with hashes and restoration provenance in
`MANIFEST.json`. The temporary helper was removed from the executable source
location only after preserving its exact bytes here. It is not a candidate,
regression result, grant, or proof. Do not execute or import the archived helper.

Active source remains commit `2a63780fd8ddd8bd97b6f2ad31ac33e969da5bae`;
active seal/evidence remains `a63169d1d84f4d81812cafa3b58c1e0624090c3e`.
Original v3 code, seals, receipts and both independent review subtrees are not
changed by this preservation record. All93 product calls remain unexecuted.

